# chorus CEC golden vector: the hub asks the TV directly (CTS 11.2.15-2).
#
# Committed, never written by a test. Rust-only by declaration (CEC runs on the Linux hub
# alone): crates/cec/tests/fixtures.rs decodes these bytes to set_system_audio_mode_on_to_tv.fields and encodes the
# fields back to these bytes. Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

